   • Student License   : Installed and used on a single physical or virtual machine.
                         Limited to a single user and a limited number of simultaneous sessions.
                         Proof of enrollment may be required.
   • Pro License       : Installed on one server and limited to up to five named users
                         and a defined number of simultaneous active sessions.
   • Business License  : Installed within a single organization site with unlimited users
                         and a defined number of simultaneous active sessions.
   • Enterprise License: Terms defined by a separate commercial agreement.
  
